		line=1250,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“North base, come in! North base!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Argh, dammit!”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I slam the unresponsive radio onto my desk.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Clutching my aching head, I stagger over and collapse onto the guest sofa.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Kanami is still lying unconscious on the marble floor across from me.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I had no choice but to choke her out when she attacked me earlier.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"What the hell is happening to Tenkyo?",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The scattered intel reports coming in all across the city all point to the same mysterious phenomenon.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Republicans and Imperials alike suddenly went berserk and started indiscriminately attacking everyone around them.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Most Imperials are unarmed, so the damage they've been able to cause is minimal, but the Republican soldiers are a different story.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The casualties from everyone in the army suddenly opening fire on their friendlies must be staggering.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"The one silver lining is that whether due to a physical condition or just pure luck, there are some like me who managed to retain their sanity at the cost of a splitting headache.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"There was one other important piece of intel I received.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Tokita-kun and Miyaguni-san were apparently spotted in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"As I furrow my brow, my headache suddenly disappears.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Looking up in a panic, I notice that the strange patterns of light covering the sky have vanished.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Soon after, the gunshots that'd been ringing out nonstop fall silent.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"─Is it over?",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"No, I can't afford to let my guard down.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Mysterious patterns appear in the sky, and everyone starts going insane and killing each other.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"And as soon as the sky goes back to normal, the killing immediately stops.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"It's like a situation straight out of fantasy, completely at odds with scientific understanding or common sense.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"But here in the Empire, that common sense doesn't mean a thing.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Because they have magicks.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I didn't fully believe it until I saw it for myself, but magicks really do exist.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Faced with the superhuman fighting strength of the warriors or the spellforce weapons Rochel developed, I had no choice but to believe it.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Give me a sitrep in your sector, now!”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“The soldiers are killing each other.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Also, hmm, looks like that transport is on fire... Oh, it just blew up.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I thought you said nothing was amiss!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Nothing ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" amiss.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Everything's going according to",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"plan.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"All this must be his doing.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I still don't know what he's playing at, but no sane man could possibly want to make all of Tenkyo's residents indiscriminately massacre each other.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What have you done?!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh, just a little dress rehearsal.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Well then, I'm afraid I have more work to attend to.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"If what happened just now was only the dress rehearsal, I can only imagine what the main event is going to be like.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"An even more horrifying scene of tragedy and madness─",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"A tragedy that will sweep up every last person in the land.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"If that's the case, this is no time to be making distinctions between Republicans and Imperials.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"We have to come together and stop Rochel.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"With this conviction, I approach the unconscious Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Without even a knock, the doors to the governor-general's office swing open.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“G-Governor-general? What brings you here?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It wouldn't do for the governor-general to be absent in a time of crisis.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Warren gives Kanami's unconscious body a cursory glance before returning his gaze to me.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We have good reason to believe that the individual responsible for this incident is Major Rochel.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He must be apprehended at once.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Leave him be.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That man was acting under my orders.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your orders?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You mean to say that all the casualties we suffered were the result of your orders?!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“A trifle compared to the value of the item Rochel will deliver to me.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Wholly indifferent to my outburst, the governor-general calmly sinks into his chair.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"He proceeds to begin polishing his nails, just as ever.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Leave your nails for later!”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What are you having Rochel make?!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The governor-general coolly turns his eyes up from his fingertips.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“An Artifact capable of bending the masses to my will.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“The fact that we suffered casualties is certainly unfortunate, but sacrifices must be made in the development of any new technology.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"He concludes, blowing on his polished nails.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Controlling the masses? What do you plan to do with a technology like that?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Make war.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Race, religion, political ideology... The pretext hardly matters.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“War will come about wherever I want it to, and the results will be whatever I want them to be.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You intend to intervene in conflicts and decide winners and losers?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“The Republic's doctrine of expansionism will reach an impasse sooner than later.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Can't you tell by looking at the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Countries are far harder to administer than they are to conquer.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Thoughtless expansionism will only bleed you dry, with hardly any profits to show for it.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“The smart politicians and businessmen have already realized that real profit lies in intervening in wars waged by others.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“What the Republic needs now isn't more territory, but a world at war it can extract profits from.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You ordered Rochel to build an Artifact for ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Warren turns his eyes to the large globe mounted on the ceiling.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“This world will become my war farm.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I intend to cultivate war as farmers cultivate wheat, reaping all the profits.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“In the coming age, rather than waging war, I will ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"make",
{"/font"},
" war in the most literal sense”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Of course, the parties involved will still believe themselves to be fighting for their ideals.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That's what Rochel's Artifact will ensure. It's an essential tool to make my war farm a reality.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've heard enough.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Manufacturing wars for nothing more than personal gain... Do you realize how many people will lose their lives?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Warren doesn't reply immediately, instead raising his polished fingernails up to the light.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“The wealth of nations is a zero-sum game.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If the Republic is to prosper, others must be condemned to poverty.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How despicable! Nothing but brutish savagery!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“How naïve. It makes me ashamed to call you my daughter.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It's only through manipulating war as you please that you can bring about the world peace you love so much.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How could instigating war possibly lead to world peace?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“War will always exist.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“To humanity, war is an incurable disease that we'll never be rid of.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“And if it cannot be cured, the best we can hope for is to control it and keep its damages to a minimum.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"I can understand the governor-general's logic.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Even if the Republic were to take over the entire world,\nwe'd never be able to enforce a lasting peace.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Independence movements would rise up immediately, and in the end, we'd be forced to withdraw from the regions we could no longer administer.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Before a major conflict breaks out, defuse the situation with a minor engagement─",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Before an enemy can raise a strong army, undermine their cause through internal strife─",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"If we really could do such things at will, maybe we really could minimize the tragedies of war.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I understand the point you're making.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Then leave Rochel to his devices.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The governor-general finally turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No matter the justification, I cannot accept the premise of controlling the populace and inciting manufactured conflicts.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All people have the fundamental right to decide what they want to fight and die for.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Enough of this inane drivel.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I refuse to compromise my human dignity. That's all.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The time I spent with the warriors opened my eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Unless people always remain true to their principles,\nthey're liable to get swept away by the muck of reality.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“There's nothing to be learned from that miserable band of wretches.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“By no means do I think they're wise. If anything, they're the biggest fools I've ever met.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No matter how overwhelming the odds, they still stare death in the eye and fight for what they believe in.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"It's a worldview that Republicans could never hope to understand.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"They'd see it as nothing but foolish and fanatical, a self-destructive road that leads only to ruin.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But that's what makes them beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“They proudly─desperately─try to live up to their ideals. Anyone who'd tell them otherwise ought to be ashamed of themselves.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And I'm going to follow in their footsteps.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I take it you consider me to be bereft of your so-called human dignity?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Lining your own pockets with the blood of others is indeed the behavior of a rapacious swine.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Yet you still answer to that swine.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I refuse to be complicit in your wrongs and become a swine myself.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Even now, I find myself strangely calm.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"What Tokita-kun taught me about fealty still resonates in my heart, even now.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors need to be ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"desperate",
{"/font"},
" about how we live our lives.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We cannot afford to spare even a moment of laxity in questioning the depth of our fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, it is all in service to our fealty that we strive to banish the hesitation from our hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think there could be nothing worse than to lose my composure and show hesitation on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Standing upon that hallowed ground where people put their very lives on the line, I need to know what it is I'm fighting to protect.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I absolutely must know what it is I'm laying down my life for.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" know what I'm fighting to protect. I'm fighting to protect the last and final modicum of virtue left within me.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"My existence is a shameful one. I know that better than anyone.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"So no matter what anyone says, no matter who stands in my way, I want to at least live up to my ideals.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Is this what you meant by living desperately, Tokita-kun?",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" stop Rochel.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"The governor-general stares curiously at me for several moments, but proceeds to pull a pistol out from his desk drawer─",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Pointing the muzzle right between my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Leave Rochel to his devices.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I refuse.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you try to stop me, I'll put you down as well.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"I draw my own pistol from its holster.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"The governor-general finally breaks our staring contest, letting out a small sigh.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“So this is how it ends.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"The governor-general dispassionately pulls the trigger─",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Khh?!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I'm suddenly knocked sideways.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Unable to break my fall, the air is knocked out of my lungs.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Y-You?!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Kanami is covering my body with her own.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You saved me?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I had no intentions of doing so, but I could not help myself.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Even though you betrayed me, I...”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"From what I can see, neither Kanami nor I are injured.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“You... actually shot me...”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"The governor-general lets out a disbelieving groan before collapsing.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I stand up together with Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That I did.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"A pool of blood slowly spreads out across the marble floor.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Trying to lead a virtuous life... is nothing but pitiful self-satisfaction.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“To control the ignoble masses, you have no choice but to mire yourself in the muck.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Yet you can't even understand that much...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“From where I stand, the only ignoble person I see is you.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Heh... Foolish to the end...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The governor-general loses consciousness, a spiteful smile still lingering on his face.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"He'll bleed out if I just leave him there.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Even he deserves a bare modicum of compassion.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Picking up the phone, I call for a medic.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Was it for the best, treating your father thus?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Her words finally bring home the realization that I've shot my own father.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Still lingering on the trigger, my finger trembles.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I truly am a fool.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Even after all this time, did some part of me still believe that he and I could come to a mutual understanding?",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Kanami peers up at me with a worried expression.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I haven't lost anything important to me.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“More to the point, why did you even save me?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As I just mentioned, it was on the spur of the moment, so I cannot say.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You really are impossible to predict, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You know, if I'd really met my maker just now, my whole performance as the villain would've all gone to waste.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Kanami silently regards me with suspicious eyes.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Five seconds pass, then ten.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Only then does she finally break her silence.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What do you mean by that?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Our promise to protect the Empire until Tokita-kun returns─I never once forgot about it.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You would say that after having the Empire annexed under your watch?!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Innumerable lives will be saved by that decision.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I don't believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Empress Hisui looks pointedly away, as if to reject any further conversation.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Look, I became the Republic's lapdog all in order to protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If the two of us had played our hand too early, we\nwould've just gotten swatted aside.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's why I had to keep you confined. In order to gain\nWarren's trust.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"In fact, the moment Tokita-kun and Miyaguni-san fled in defeat, there wasn't much I could do.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Keeping Kanami alive was my only priority at that point.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"I believed that even if Tokita-kun and Miyaguni-san never returned, there would still be hope so long as Kanami was kept alive.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I don't believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Why would a Republican such as you go so far for the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I simply wish to live a life without regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The warriors live such honest lives, putting their lives on the line to protect what they must. I want to live just like that.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even if I have the whole world against me.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"I certainly don't expect to be able to die a decent death.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"But that's fine.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"So long as in the end, I can look back on my life with my head held high, that's enough.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My next move is to go and stop Rochel.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That man used not only Imperials, but the whole Republican Army as test subjects for his new weapon.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He is a threat to all of Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"I pause, staring into Kanami's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't expect you to trust me.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But still, I need your help.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hehee, no one has ever asked for my assistance in such a horrible manner before.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're one to talk. You'd turn on me in a heartbeat if it's for Tokita-kun's sake, wouldn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Why, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Kanami flashes me an utterly shameless smile.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Turns out I'm no different.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you're going to stand between me and my ideals, I\nwon't hesitate to stab you in the back.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Just now, I put down not only my father, but also my weak past self.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"She",
{"/font"},
" might have contented herself with hollow complaints to her superiors, but no longer will ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" stand idly by.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Still, right now, our interests happen to be aligned.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“At least until we defeat Rochel, I have no reason to turn on you.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And after that?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll leave that to your judgment.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"I offer Kanami my hand.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Will she agree to cooperate with me?",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you thinking all this is cheap talk from someone who shot her own father?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Need I remind you that I'm someone who impersonated Her Majesty out of love for her own brother?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Shall we join hands as two wicked women who've strayed far from the righteous path?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Kanami takes my hand firmly into her grip.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oomikami will surely have no mercy on the likes of us.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He ain't seen nothing yet.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"We squeeze each other's hands tight.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well then, how may I be of assistance?”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you be able to rally the warriors in your name?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Rallying the warriors...”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Kanami pauses, her expression becoming strained.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“During Operation Bellflower, the warriors were routed by that Artifact.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“This time will surely be no...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No warrior I know would use that as an excuse for getting cold feet.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed, it is as you say.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No matter the circumstances, the warriors shall always fight on.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you to assemble them.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Leave it to me.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Kanami gives me an emphatic nod.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What are you intending to do, Elsa-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll direct the Republican Army on a manhunt for Rochel.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I won't let him get away with anything else.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ugh... kgh...”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"A high-pitched noise shakes me out of my stupor.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"The first thing I see when I open my eyes is the damp stone of my cell walls.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"At some point, I must have fallen to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Picking myself up into a sitting position, I look around for a sign.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"─How long have I been here? What day is it today?",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Nothing in the room gives any indication of how much time has passed.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"The last thing I remember is the sight of my father being controlled like a puppet by Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"She must have cast some spell on me, because everything after that was nothing but darkness.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I might even have been asleep ever since that day.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(How is everyone else doing?)”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"That day, it seemed like Sekka discovered where Kotone was hiding.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"I can't imagine that the Republican Army would simply leave them be, so in the worst-case scenario, they could all already be dead.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Father...)”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Soujin...!)”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Still, I have to stay strong and keep fighting.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Not out of a sense of obligation or duty.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"But because I want to, pure and simple.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"Everyone has some precious thing they would fight to protect.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Whether country, or property, or family, or love─the reasons are as numerous as people themselves.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"But what about me?",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"What is it that I fight for?",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"My comrades in the Sworn Blades?",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"My duty as the head of House Inou?",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"These reasons would not be wrong, but neither are they the whole truth.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"What animates me is the very essence of what makes up Inou Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"If I had to put it into words, it would be my pride in what it means to be a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"I recall the time Soujin and I escaped the palace dungeons together.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Amidst that hail of bullets, the two of us danced across the battlefield, his back to mine.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Ah, the indescribable pleasure I felt back then.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"The ecstasy as the boundary between me and Soujin blurred until we became one.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Enrapt in the dizzying joy of that moment, I felt it, as surely as I know I am to die─",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That I was born to be a warrior.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"The battlefield is my destiny, and it is only on the battlefield that I can experience the greatest pleasure known to man.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"Curse and jeer me for being a murderer, but I'll always take pride in the blood of the Forefather flowing through my veins.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"That's why I'll never stop fighting.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"My piety towards my ancestors? My duty as chairman of the Sworn Blades? I'm sorry to admit that they hardly matter to me.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"It doesn't even matter whether my fight ends in victory or defeat.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Simply, inexorably, I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" continue to fight until my life burns out, just as a beast of prey will continue to hunt until the end of its days.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Even without a blade, so long as my body remains whole and my soul remains pure─",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That is all I need.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Soujin, I'll never give in.)”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"I straighten my back and close my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"Letting out a long, even breath, I clear my mind.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"This technique has been drilled into me ever since I was a child.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"A meditation that calms the heart and sharpens the nerves, turning my mind and body into that of a warrior worthy to stand on the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"That nothing I see will faze me─",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"That no foe I encounter will daunt me─",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"My senses sharpened to their limit, I detect many things I previously wasn't able to.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"─The rhythmic pounding of military boots on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"─The nervous breathing of men prepared to die.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"─The dense billowing of fighting spirit, ready to be unleashed.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Just how many opponents are out there, waiting for me?",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"My skin tingles with anticipation at the imminent battle.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"My hunger and pain from being tortured vanish in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"Go now, Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Just now, I heard Soujin's voice.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"That was no hallucination.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"He is out there somewhere, alive and fighting.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"That's why his will was able to reach me.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"With visions of dawn breaking over the Empire, I slowly open my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Watch me... Soujin.)”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"The sound of approaching footsteps echoes down the corridor.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"A few moments later, my cell door creaks open.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"Illuminated by the harsh light of the corridor behind them, two young women step into view.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I expected you to be in pretty bad shape, but you seem to be holding up well.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is it time?”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yep. A call from none other than Her Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"Kanami steps out from behind Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"A voice of cold command echoes throughout my cell.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"It tells me that Kanami has come here as Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Tenkyo has been beset by grave peril.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“We must join hands with the Republican Army to see this threat eliminated.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What is this threat?”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Major Rochel Elliot of the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“He threatens to visit untold calamity upon every last resident of Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In the name of the 87th sovereign of the Empire, Empress Hisui, I hereby invoke the Edict of the Sun.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"The Edict of the Sun─",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"The highest level of order that can be issued in the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"It grants the Empress absolute sovereignty over her subjects for the purpose of preserving the realm in times of crisis.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"No Imperial has any authority to oppose it.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Head of House Inou, Inou Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I require your strength.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Empress Hisui presents me the wakizashi at her side.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My blade is yours.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			{
"I lower my head to the ground as I receive the blade.",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your servant Inou Hotori was born as a warrior for none other than this day. I shall devote all my soul to Your\nMajesty's service.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“With Your Majesty and the spirits of all those possessing the blood of the Forefather as my witness, I hereby swear my allegiance and resolve to be true.”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"Holding the wakizashi at eye level, I unsheathe it halfway.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"The cold steel reflects my determined gaze back at me.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"I will fight.",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"To protect my pride as a warrior, I will fight.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
